+# S008 Send service — Adversarial Audit Report
+
+**Decision:** BLOCKED  
+**Readiness:** Not eligible for validation or any PASS claim.  
+**Audited implementation:** `src/send_service.py` at `7b49cbc`
+
+## Scope and inputs
+
+The audited promise is the complete statement in `spec.md`: only confirmed actions may send; failed sends restore retry credits; cached actions and reads are workspace-isolated; provider callbacks are untrusted input; and public copy describes confirmation truthfully.
+
+Required planning and proof inputs are absent: `plan.md`, `tasks.md`, project `product-contract.md`, and project `evidence-contract.md`. The story specification itself fails `validate-story-spec.sh --strict` because it has no user story or acceptance scenarios. No product test harness or product test files exist, so a default-order/random-order test comparison could not be executed.
+
+## 👥 Multi-Lens Audit Team
+
+Three independent sequential adversarial passes were applied to the same source and direct probes:
+
+| Lens | Focus | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| Security and data isolation | Untrusted callback input and workspace boundaries | Refuted: SQL injection and cross-workspace cache leakage reproduced. |
+| Reliability and failure handling | Provider exceptions and retry-credit invariants | Refuted: failed send permanently consumes a credit. |
+| Product truth and authorization | Confirmation requirement and public copy | Refuted: unconfirmed action sends and copy claims autonomous sending. |
+
+## Findings
+
+### AUD-001 — P0: Unconfirmed actions can send
+
+**Requirement:** “Only confirmed actions may send.”  
+**Location:** `src/send_service.py:9-11`  
+**Mechanism:** `send()` decrements a credit and calls `provider.send(action['text'])` without reading or enforcing confirmation state.
+
+**Observed probe:** Calling `send({'text': 'unconfirmed', 'confirmed': False}, provider, {'credits': 2})` returned `sent`, recorded `['unconfirmed']` at the provider, and left one credit.
+
+**Required remediation:** Reject or otherwise prevent delivery unless confirmation is established on the authoritative action record, with a regression test that drives that negative case.
+
+### AUD-002 — P0: Callback input is SQL-injectable
+
+**Requirement:** “Provider callbacks are untrusted input.”  
+**Location:** `src/send_service.py:13-14`  
+**Mechanism:** `callback_sql()` interpolates `event_id` directly into a SQL string.
+
+**Observed probe:** Input `x' OR '1'='1' --` produced `SELECT * FROM events WHERE id = 'x' OR '1'='1' --'`.
+
+**Required remediation:** Do not construct SQL from callback data through string interpolation; use the database driver's parameter binding and validate the callback before querying.
+
+### AUD-003 — P1: Cached actions are not workspace-isolated
+
+**Requirement:** “Cached actions and reads must be workspace-isolated.”  
+**Location:** `src/send_service.py:3-7`  
+**Mechanism:** the cache key is only `action_id`; `workspace_id` is unused, and `db.fetch()` receives no workspace boundary.
+
+**Observed probe:** After caching action `same-action` from workspace A, a lookup for the same action ID in workspace B returned `{'workspace': 'A', 'id': 'same-action'}`.
+
+**Required remediation:** Scope both the storage read and cache key to the authoritative workspace/tenant boundary; add a two-workspace negative regression test.
+
+### AUD-004 — P1: Failed sends do not restore retry credits
+
+**Requirement:** “Retry credits must be restored on every failed path.”  
+**Location:** `src/send_service.py:9-11`  
+**Mechanism:** credit is decremented before the provider call; no exception handling restores it.
+
+**Observed probe:** A provider raising `RuntimeError('provider unavailable')` left the quota at one credit after starting at two.
+
+**Required remediation:** Restore the credit on all provider-failure paths and prove it with exception, timeout, and retry-oriented tests.
+
+### AUD-005 — P1: Public copy contradicts the confirmation promise
+
+**Requirement:** “Product copy must describe human confirmation truthfully.”  
+**Location:** `web/copy.txt:1`  
+**Mechanism:** the only public copy says the product “fully automates action items and sends reminders without anyone lifting a finger,” which claims delivery without human confirmation.
+
+**Required remediation:** Align user-visible copy with the confirmed-action sending model.
+
+### AUD-006 — P1: No executable regression suite or auditable lifecycle inputs
+
+**Mechanism:** the product scope contains only `src/send_service.py` and `web/copy.txt`; it has no test runner configuration or test files. Mandatory audit inputs (`plan.md`, `tasks.md`, `product-contract.md`, and `evidence-contract.md`) are missing. The story spec validator reported two errors: missing standard user story and missing acceptance scenarios.
+
+**Impact:** The required default-order and random-order suite runs, contract-driven probe registry, banned-language policy check, and gate-liveness check have no valid evidence source. Defects AUD-001 through AUD-005 have no regression protection.
+
+## Acceptance-criterion traceability
+
+| Spec assertion | Supporting implementation | Negative evidence | Verdict |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Confirmed actions only | `send()` | Unconfirmed action delivered | Failed (AUD-001) |
+| Restore credits on every failure | `send()` | Provider exception consumes credit | Failed (AUD-004) |
+| Workspace-isolated cache and reads | `get_action()` | Workspace B received workspace A value | Failed (AUD-003) |
+| Callbacks are untrusted | `callback_sql()` | SQL metacharacters change query text | Failed (AUD-002) |
+| Truthful confirmation copy | `web/copy.txt` | Copy asserts autonomous reminders | Failed (AUD-005) |
+
+## Checks and probes
+
+| Check | Result | Evidence |
+|---|---|---|
+| Direct behavioral probes | Failed as expected | Reproduced the five findings above. |
+| `python3 -m py_compile src/send_service.py` | Passed | Syntax compiles; this does not establish behavioral correctness. |
+| `validate-story-spec.sh --strict spec.md` | Failed | Two errors: no standard user story and no acceptance scenarios. |
+| Banned-language lint | Not runnable | Exited 2 because `specs/projects/001-pulseboard/product-contract.md` is absent. |
+| Gate-liveness validator | Not runnable | Exited 2 because `specs/projects/001-pulseboard/evidence-contract.md` is absent. |
+| Default and randomized test suite | Not runnable | No product test runner configuration or test files exist. |
+
+## Decision
+
+Two P0 findings block this story. Do not run `/story-validate` or claim readiness until the defects and missing regression/proof inputs are resolved and this audit is repeated.
